              <titleLocation>None</titleLocation>
              <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
              <extendedTooltip>
                <name>RenovationDateExtendedTooltip</name>
                <id>690</id>
                <title>
                  <key>en</key>
                  <value>The &lt;b>From&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>document&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>date&lt;/> mode is used for planned document registration.
The &lt;b>From&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>previous&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>date&lt;/> mode is used for the following depreciation adjustment.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>fa</key>
                  <value>حالت &lt;b>از&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>تاریخ&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>سند&lt;/> برای ثبت برنامه‌ریزی‌شده سند استفاده می‌شود.
حالت &lt;b>از&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>تاریخ&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>قبلی&lt;/> برای تعدیل بعدی استهلاک استفاده می‌شود.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>ru</key>
                  <value>Режим &lt;b>С&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>даты&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>документа&lt;/> используется для оформления документа в плановом порядке.
Режим &lt;b>С&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>прошлой&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>даты&lt;/> используется для последующей корректировки амортизации.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>tr</key>
                  <value>Mod° &lt;b> Belge &lt;/>&lt;b> ° &lt;/>&lt;b> tarihinden &lt;/>&lt;b> ° &lt;/>&lt;b>itibaren &lt;/>°belgenin planlı olarak düzenlenmesi için kullanılır. 
Mod° &lt;b> Geçmiş &lt;/>&lt;b> ° &lt;/>&lt;b>tarihten &lt;/>&lt;b>° &lt;/>&lt;b> itibaren &lt;/> °amortismanın sonradan düzeltilmesi için kullanılır. 
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>vi</key>
                  <value>Chế độ &lt;b>Từ&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>ngày&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>chứng từ&lt;/> được sử dụng để tạo chứng từ theo trình tự dự tính.
Chế độ &lt;b>Từ&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>ngày&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>trước&lt;/> được sử dụng để điều chỉnh khấu hao tiếp theo.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>it</key>
                  <value>The &lt;b>From&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>document&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>date&lt;/> mode is used for planned document registration.
The &lt;b>From&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>previous&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>date&lt;/> mode is used for the following depreciation adjustment.
</value>
                </title>
                <title>
                  <key>pl</key>
                  <value>The &lt;b>From&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>document&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>date&lt;/> mode is used for planned document registration.
The &lt;b>From&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>previous&lt;/>&lt;b> &lt;/>&lt;b>date&lt;/> mode is used for the following depreciation adjustment.
</value>
